    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Call to Return to the",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the eighth month of the second year of Darius, the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to the prophet Zechariah son of Berekiah, the son of Iddo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was very angry with your ancestors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore tell the people: This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: 'Return to me,' declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, 'and I will return to you,' says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be like your ancestors, to whom the earlier prophets proclaimed: This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: 'Turn from your evil ways and your evil practices.' But they would not listen or pay attention to me, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where are your ancestors now? And the prophets, do they live forever?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But did not my words and my decrees, which I commanded my servants the prophets, overtake your ancestors?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ZEC 1:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Then they repented and said, 'The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty has done to us what our ways and practices deserve, just as he determined to do.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Man Among the Myrtle Trees",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the twenty-fourth day of the eleventh month, the month of Shebat, in the second year of Darius, the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to the prophet Zechariah son of Berekiah, the son of Iddo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "During the night I had a vision, and there before me was a man mounted on a red horse. He was standing among the myrtle trees in a ravine. Behind him were red, brown and white horses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I asked, \"What are these, my lord?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ZEC 1:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The angel who was talking with me answered, \"I will show you what they are.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man standing among the myrtle trees explained, \"They are the ones the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has sent to go throughout the earth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they reported to the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who was standing among the myrtle trees, \"We have gone throughout the earth and found the whole world at rest and in peace.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said, \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, how long will you withhold mercy from Jerusalem and from the towns of Judah, which you have been angry with these seventy years?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spoke kind and comforting words to the angel who talked with me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the angel who was speaking to me said, \"Proclaim this word: This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: 'I am very jealous for Jerusalem and Zion,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I am very angry with the nations that feel secure. I was only a little angry, but they went too far with the punishment.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Therefore this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'I will return to Jerusalem with mercy, and there my house will be rebuilt. And the measuring line will be stretched out over Jerusalem,' declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.1.16"
                ]
